diff --git b/docs/CONFIGURATION.md a/docs/CONFIGURATION.md
index dadb93c..874eb29 100644
--- b/docs/CONFIGURATION.md
+++ a/docs/CONFIGURATION.md
@@ -86,6 +86,7 @@ The table above is the short list. This part covers the remaining `MOE_CACHE_*`
 | `MOE_CACHE_GPU_TMPL` | Experimental. Keeps finished long-prompt GPU graphs and reuses them for later blocks of the same shape, padding blocks that use a few more or fewer experts. Ignored if MOE_CACHE_GPU_KEEP_MIB is above 0. 1/on/true/yes turns it on. | off | internal/testing |
 | `MOE_CACHE_HALFLIFE` | How fast old expert-use counts fade in the smart (class-based) eviction policy, in decode steps: a count halves after this many steps. Values below 1 are raised to 1. Read as a number. | 128 | advanced |
 | `MOE_CACHE_HYBRID_COMPACT` | Experimental, hybrid GPU mode: when some of the experts a token needs are missing, the GPU computes only the ones that are present (and only those rows are read back) instead of all of them. 1/on/true/yes turns it on. | off | internal/testing |
+| `MOE_CACHE_IDLE_ADAPT` | On-demand launcher only: after 8 requests, frees the cache RAM after 1.5 times the typical (90th percentile) pause between requests, at least 30 s and never later than the configured time. Only the exact value `1` turns it on. | off | advanced |
 | `MOE_CACHE_IDLE_REBALANCE_GAIN` | Idle refill: how much better (in score) an expert not in RAM must be than the resident one it would replace; higher means fewer swaps. Read as a decimal number, values below 1 become 1. Only used while idle refill is on. | 2.0 | internal/testing |
 | `MOE_CACHE_IDLE_REBALANCE_MB` | Idle refill: most megabytes of experts it reads in one idle period. Whole number, minimum 1. Only used while idle refill is on. | 512 | advanced |
 | `MOE_CACHE_IDLE_REBALANCE_MS` | Idle refill: how many milliseconds without any graph running (an agent waiting for a tool) before the refill starts. 0 turns idle refill off. | 1500 | advanced |
